Arrangements for provision of general ophthalmic services.: Section 26) **Arrangements for provision of general ophthalmic services.**

1) It shall be the duty of every Health Board to make as respects their area, in accordance with regulations, arrangements with medical practitioners having the prescribed qualifications, and with ophthalmic opticians , for securing the carrying out of eye examinations including where clinically necessary testing of sight. 
